# Camellia, the Seedmiser {1}{B}{G}, 3/3 with menace: "Other Squirrels you control have menace" and "Whenever you sacrifice one or more
# Foods, create a 1/1 green Squirrel creature token." Turn 1: Bot1 casts Camellia with three Moxen and a Gilded Goose (a Food Goose makes
# on entering) with a Forest. Turn 2: Bot2 casts a Goose of its own. Turn 3: Bot1 sacrifices its Food to the Goose (a Food sacrificed
# as a cost, CR 701.21) and gets a Squirrel, which has menace as another Squirrel, while Camellia keeps her printed menace and the Goose
# has none; Black Lotus, no Food, sacrificed for mana makes none. Turn 4: Bot2 sacrifices its own Food and casts The Unbeatable Squirrel
# Girl, which makes a Squirrel token of its own: no Squirrel for Bot1. On turn 6 that token attacks and one Camellia blocks it alone and kills it: it has no menace, being no Squirrel of Bot1's.

